This directory holds no examples at the moment. Its CMakeLists.txt only
provides the examples-courtier target, so that courtier is laid out like the
other libraries.

Programs that show how courtier is used:

  * ../docprograms/minimal_consumer.cpp -- a small, complete consumer, quoted
    by the Geneva manual and run as a test;
  * ../tests/UnitTests/ and ../tests/ManualTests/ -- the library's tests.

A user such as Geneva shows more: its examples 15_GMPIConsumer and
16_GMPISubClients in libs/geneva/examples/ use the consumers directly.
